    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilombi jelomba wutesia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni bugha kwako oho kunonagha kusenonelo; oho kukaliagha, kusekalilo. Kukameria kunona, kuchanonwa. Kukameria kukalia, kuchakalilwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudifue wughoma ee BWANA, isi dikusuwiriagha oho kukaie mlindiri odu kula nakesho; kukaie kukia kodu ngelo ya wasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wakimbia kwa kusikira ndoghoi mbaa; kukawuka kimusi, mbari ra wandu rasaghisika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mali rawo rawadwa seji shimandu riwadwagha, wandu wichariwada seji zighe riwadwagha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA wachua wubaa, kwa kukaia andu kwake kokaia ni kwa ighu. Uchaichura Jerusalemu na maza ra hachi na loli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA uchakaia kumanga konyu ngelo renyu rose; uchakaia kukia konyu kwa wungi, hikima na kumanya; mali renyu richakaia ni uko kumuobua BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olenyi awo wiko na ndighi wiakema chienyi, wadumwa wenyu wereda sere wialila kwa kuwawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chia mbaa reesighwa nduu, awo wadambi wamerie kusia. Mapatano ghaawuyachikanywa na washahidi kumenywa; ndekuwadie kutala wandu kungi anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isanga jeewuya ja wasi, jiasia; msidu ghwa Lebanoni ghoonyaya na kunoneka, Sharoni eeka sa ikara; hata aho Bashani na Mghondi ghwa Karmeli midi eewadwa ni pambari na kupotua malemba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "BWANA kuwionya wamaiza wake",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA waghamba, “Idana nichawuka, nichajoswa na kunekwa wubaa ghwapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mipango enyu ni ya duu, eeka sa kuwa makozi na kukuwida matasa; miruke enyu yawuya modo ghommeria mmbeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wichawuya seji weekorwa na kuwuya chokaa; wichawuya sa minjwa idemelo na kukorwa modonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula mundu ndesikire! Ukaiagha kula angu ukaiagha kaavui, usikire seji nibonyere, nao ughore seji ndighi ra wubaa ghwapo riko.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakaung'a wikaiagha Sioni wiasughusika kwa wowa, awo wandu wisemuobuagha Mlungu wakaia na wowa wikighamba, “Nani udimagha kukaia kimusi kwa kutanya kwa Mlungu kuko sa modo ghubirie? Nani aghadi kodu udimagha kukaianya na modo ghwa kala na kala?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni uja ubonyagha hachi, na kudeda agho ghiko gha loli; umenyagha mapato ghiseko gha hachi, na kughiria mikonu yake isewade matuwo; uo ughiriagha madu ghake ghisesikire njama rebwagha, na kuleghazighana wuwiwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uo mundu uchakaia banana, andu kuko na wulindiri ghukate sa ngome ya magho; uchanekwa vindo vake na machi ghake ghimkate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngelo ndicha ichagha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meso ghako ghichammbona mzuri ukasikie, uko na wubaa mungi; na kuzighana isanga ibaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchakumbuka agho gherekuoboshagha na kukotia, “Weko hao waja weredilawiagha kodi? Weko hao waja werekoghe wikilawua minara yedu ya wulindiri?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wang'eti ndekuchaawiwona, wandu wa madedo gha kighenyi ghisekueliagha; widedagha seji wiaghughumia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zighana muzi ghwa Sioni, ugho ghoresaghuloghe ghukaie andu kobonyera ndima redu ra dini. Kuchawona Jerusalemu muzi ghwa sere ghumange. Wandu waro wichakaia kwa sere, na vigingi va hema rawo ndevichaakulwa, hata kamba raro nderichaadumbulwa anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho BWANA uchakaia ukiditesia; kuchakaia na meda mibaa na mitini, andu meli ra wamaiza risedimagha kughenda, hata meli ra wabaa risedimagha kuida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu BWANA nuo mtanyi odu, BWANA nuo udibonyeragha nguma; BWANA nuo mzuri odu, nao uchadikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamba rawo ra meli nderimange; nderidimagha kuwadia mlingoti ghwa meli nicha. Aho niko dichadwa wunyika na kuwagha mali nyingi, hata mkelemeri ndechaasowa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndekuchaakaia na mndungi isangenyi ughoragha wei, “Neeka mkongo”; kwa kukaia wandu wichaakaia aho, wichalekelwa mawiwi ghawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
